  "instruction_steps": [
    {
      "step_number": 1,
      "instruction": "A note about the espresso: I like using the fine ground espresso brick and making the coffee in a regular moka pot, but you can certainly also use the Nespresso style capsules if you have that type of espresso maker. FULL DISCLOSURE: I personally prefer the decaf espresso, which the Cafe La Llave brand makes to perfection. The ice cream flavor holds either way.",
      "ingredients_used": [
        "fa8ce0a2-ba1a-5ac1-b70d-595849ce8582"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 2,
      "instruction": "In a medium saucepan, heat the cream, milk, sugar and salt over medium heat; whisking to dissolve the sugar (this should take about 4 to 5 minutes).",
      "timer_seconds": 300,
      "ingredients_used": [
        "47f0c323-caec-5bf6-9f4d-9904955f9bf7",
        "154c95fd-7054-5878-ace2-12c2e2277fd9",
        "b07cdf84-3323-5932-9fe4-cacf02a0b6c8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 3,
      "instruction": "In a separate bowl, whisk the egg yolks.",
      "ingredients_used": [
        "95784a5b-6ac3-5b34-a80e-611c18e4b37c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 4,
      "instruction": "Gradually pour about 1 cup of the hot milk mixture into the egg yolk bowl, while continually whisking. Do this carefully to temper the eggs. (You’re not cooking them.)",
      "ingredients_used": [
        "47f0c323-caec-5bf6-9f4d-9904955f9bf7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 5,
      "instruction": "Add the tempered egg yolk mix back into the pan while whisking until it just comes to a simmer."
    },
    {
      "step_number": 6,
      "instruction": "Remove the pan from the heat, then add the vanilla extract and espresso.",
      "ingredients_used": [
        "3e855ddd-9478-51c5-9a55-f7a183b29e11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 7,
      "instruction": "you can use any ice cream maker. It doesn’t have to be fancy."
    },
    {
      "step_number": 8,
      "instruction": "Use between 2 and 4 shots of espresso (regular or decaf) depending on how strong you like the coffee flavor in the ice cream. I think about 3 shots is ideal."
    },
    {
      "step_number": 9,
      "instruction": "This recipe will yield about 1 quart of ice cream."
    },
    {
      "step_number": 10,
      "instruction": "Please sit back and enjoy your espresso ice cream. Also, stay cool. You’re welcome"
    }
  ],
